# 31. RESISTANCE CALCULATION

Resistance Medical dihitung secara individual berdasarkan stat setiap Hero.

Contoh:

```text
Hero A Fire Resistance:
10%

Hero B Fire Resistance:
20%
```

Medical Lv.9:

```text
Fire Resistance:
+25%
```

Final:

```text
Hero A:
35%

Hero B:
45%
```

Jika Hero A menerima:

```text
Fire Damage = 10,000
```

maka:

```text
10,000 × (1 - 0.35)

= 6,500 Damage
```

Jika Hero B menerima:

```text
Fire Damage = 10,000
```

maka:

```text
10,000 × (1 - 0.45)

= 5,500 Damage
```

